[{"id":"archive-508","post_id":"508","platform":"facebook","author":"zuck","original_url":"https://www.facebook.com/zuck/posts/10102557276035121","published_at":null,"published_date":"2015-12-25","date_precision":"day","source_ids":["zuckerberg-files"],"source_url":"https://epublications.marquette.edu/zuckerberg_files_transcripts/508/","text":"Merry Christmas and happy holidays from Priscilla, Max, Beast and me!\n \nSeeing all the moments of joy and friendship shared on Facebook today is one of my favorite things about our community.\n \nThis...","like_count":null,"likes_captured_at":null,"likes_source":null,"text_status":"captured_original_page_description","text_source":"https://www.facebook.com/zuck/posts/10102557276035121","text_truncated":false},{"id":"archive-507","post_id":"507","platform":"facebook","author":"zuck","original_url":"https://www.facebook.com/zuck/posts/10102542090197661","published_at":null,"published_date":"2015-12-21","date_precision":"day","source_ids":["zuckerberg-files"],"source_url":"https://epublications.marquette.edu/zuckerberg_files_transcripts/507/","text":"This is a beautiful story about friendship. It's why we work every day to make the world more open and connected.","like_count":null,"likes_captured_at":null,"likes_source":null,"text_status":"captured_original_page_description","text_source":"https://www.facebook.com/zuck/posts/10102542090197661","text_truncated":false},{"id":"archive-506","post_id":"506","platform":"facebook","author":"zuck","original_url":"https://www.facebook.com/zuck/posts/10102531236433691","published_at":null,"published_date":"2015-12-17","date_precision":"day","source_ids":["zuckerberg-files"],"source_url":"https://epublications.marquette.edu/zuckerberg_files_transcripts/506/","text":"This has been a memorable year. We grew our little family, expanded our philanthropy, reached one billion people on Facebook every day, shipped virtual reality, built drones to beam down internet...","like_count":null,"likes_captured_at":null,"likes_source":null,"text_status":"captured_original_page_description","text_source":"https://www.facebook.com/zuck/posts/10102531236433691","text_truncated":false},{"id":"archive-504","post_id":"504","platform":"facebook","author":"zuck","original_url":"https://www.facebook.com/zuck/posts/10102530374780451","published_at":null,"published_date":"2015-12-17","date_precision":"day","source_ids":["zuckerberg-files"],"source_url":"https://epublications.marquette.edu/zuckerberg_files_transcripts/504/","text":"Tonight, a Brazilian judge blocked WhatsApp for more than 100 million people who rely on it in her country.\n\nWe are working hard to get this block reversed. Until then, Facebook Messenger is still...","like_count":null,"likes_captured_at":null,"likes_source":null,"text_status":"captured_original_page_description","text_source":"https://www.facebook.com/zuck/posts/10102530374780451","text_truncated":false},{"id":"archive-503","post_id":"503","platform":"facebook","author":"zuck","original_url":"https://www.facebook.com/photo.php?fbid=10102525763127241&set=a.529237706231.2034669.4&type=3&theater","published_at":null,"published_date":"2015-12-14","date_precision":"day","source_ids":["zuckerberg-files"],"source_url":"https://epublications.marquette.edu/zuckerberg_files_transcripts/503/","text":null,"like_count":null,"likes_captured_at":null,"likes_source":null,"text_status":"unavailable","text_source":null,"text_truncated":false},{"id":"archive-502","post_id":"502","platform":"facebook","author":"zuck","original_url":"https://www.facebook.com/zuck/posts/10102520494226161","published_at":null,"published_date":"2015-12-11","date_precision":"day","source_ids":["zuckerberg-files"],"source_url":"https://epublications.marquette.edu/zuckerberg_files_transcripts/502/","text":"President Aquino of the Philippines voiced his support for connectivity and Internet.org by signing the Connectivity Declaration, the pledge we launched this year to make internet access a reality...","like_count":null,"likes_captured_at":null,"likes_source":null,"text_status":"captured_original_page_description","text_source":"https://www.facebook.com/zuck/posts/10102520494226161","text_truncated":false},{"id":"archive-501","post_id":"501","platform":"facebook","author":"zuck","original_url":"https://www.facebook.com/zuck/posts/10102517406079831","published_at":null,"published_date":"2015-12-09","date_precision":"day","source_ids":["zuckerberg-files"],"source_url":"https://epublications.marquette.edu/zuckerberg_files_transcripts/501/","text":"I want to add my voice in support of Muslims in our community and around the world.\n\nAfter the Paris attacks and hate this week, I can only imagine the fear Muslims feel that they will be persecuted...","like_count":null,"likes_captured_at":null,"likes_source":null,"text_status":"captured_original_page_description","text_source":"https://www.facebook.com/zuck/posts/10102517406079831","text_truncated":false},{"id":"archive-898","post_id":"898","platform":"facebook","author":"zuck","original_url":"https://www.facebook.com/zuck/videos/10102509264909801/","published_at":null,"published_date":"2015-12-04","date_precision":"day","source_ids":["zuckerberg-files"],"source_url":"https://epublications.marquette.edu/zuckerberg_files_transcripts/898/","text":"I want to share a few more thoughts on the Chan Zuckerberg Initiative before I just start posting photos of me and Max for a while :)\n\nI hope one idea comes through: that we as a society should make...","like_count":null,"likes_captured_at":null,"likes_source":null,"text_status":"captured_original_page_description","text_source":"https://www.facebook.com/zuck/videos/10102509264909801/","text_truncated":false},{"id":"archive-500","post_id":"500","platform":"facebook","author":"zuck","original_url":"https://www.facebook.com/zuck/posts/10102509194685531","published_at":null,"published_date":"2015-12-04","date_precision":"day","source_ids":["zuckerberg-files"],"source_url":"https://epublications.marquette.edu/zuckerberg_files_transcripts/500/","text":"This piece by Felix Salmon is the most thoughtful writing on the Chan Zuckerberg Initiative that I've read so far, and it explains our philosophy well:\n\n\"As he has explained in a thoughtful letter to...","like_count":null,"likes_captured_at":null,"likes_source":null,"text_status":"captured_original_page_description","text_source":"https://www.facebook.com/zuck/posts/10102509194685531","text_truncated":false},{"id":"archive-499","post_id":"499","platform":"facebook","author":"zuck","original_url":"https://www.facebook.com/zuck/posts/10102507695055801","published_at":null,"published_date":"2015-12-03","date_precision":"day","source_ids":["zuckerberg-files"],"source_url":"https://epublications.marquette.edu/zuckerberg_files_transcripts/499/","text":"I want to thank you all for your heartwarming congratulations on Max's birth and on starting the Chan Zuckerberg Initiative. This whole community has been so loving and supportive.\n\nIf you're...","like_count":null,"likes_captured_at":null,"likes_source":null,"text_status":"captured_original_page_description","text_source":"https://www.facebook.com/zuck/posts/10102507695055801","text_truncated":false},{"id":"archive-897","post_id":"897","platform":"facebook","author":"zuck","original_url":"https://www.facebook.com/zuck/videos/10102505356651981/","published_at":null,"published_date":"2015-12-02","date_precision":"day","source_ids":["zuckerberg-files"],"source_url":"https://epublications.marquette.edu/zuckerberg_files_transcripts/897/","text":"A few weeks before Max's birth, Priscilla and I took a morning to reflect and record our hopes for her and all children of her generation.\n\nIt will be deeply meaningful to show this to her one day....","like_count":null,"likes_captured_at":null,"likes_source":null,"text_status":"captured_original_page_description","text_source":"https://www.facebook.com/zuck/videos/10102505356651981/","text_truncated":false},{"id":"archive-498","post_id":"498","platform":"facebook","author":"zuck","original_url":"https://www.facebook.com/zuck/posts/10153375081581634","published_at":null,"published_date":"2015-12-01","date_precision":"day","source_ids":["zuckerberg-files"],"source_url":"https://epublications.marquette.edu/zuckerberg_files_transcripts/498/","text":"Priscilla and I are so happy to welcome our daughter Max into this world!\n\nFor her birth, we wrote a letter to her about the world we hope she grows up in.\n\nIt's a world where our generation can...","like_count":null,"likes_captured_at":null,"likes_source":null,"text_status":"captured_original_page_description","text_source":"https://www.facebook.com/zuck/posts/10153375081581634","text_truncated":false}]